body:
Isn't the condition the opposite of what you want?

Although, it looks like you're just carrying forward the condition from the original code... I think it's wrong, though:
```
  if (!implemented?(ExtensionName::A) || (MISA_CSR_IMPLEMENTED && (CSR[misa].A == 0'b0))) {
    raise (ExceptionCode::IllegalInstruction, mode(), $encoding);
  }
```
This applies to all of the other layouts as well.

